  "details": "Recently, the old loading screen got added as a benefit for VRC+. \n\nI think this loading screen should be granted to all users who played before the loading screen was changed at some point in early 2018, then remain as a paid feature for any accounts after this date.\n\nit's really disappointing to have waited so long for this option only for it to locked behind a subscription I have no need to buy. Please consider granting this to legacy users or making it free for everyone as an exception. If that isn't possible, then make it a purchasable item rather than locking it to a subscription benefit.\n\nLikewise, it would be nice to have the old portals as a similar option.",
